{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu064-e-sr-zhangzhao-toast","title":"诸葛恪论难张昭使尽爵","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-6422e71002be88b8df96","label":"正文","text":"权命恪行酒至张昭前，昭不肯饮谓非养老之礼；权言能令张公辞屈乃当饮；恪引师尚父九秩秉钺难昭，昭卒无辞遂为尽爵","evidence":["santizhu064-q-13d8e693cd68e444b7cd"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"命恪行酒并设难","evidence":["santizhu064-q-13d8e693cd68e444b7cd"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0041","role":"论难张昭","evidence":["santizhu064-q-13d8e693cd68e444b7cd"]},{"person":"wendi-p0133","role":"辞屈尽爵","evidence":["santizhu064-q-13d8e693cd68e444b7cd"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-13d8e693cd68e444b7cd"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-13d8e693cd68e444b7cd","source_order":[64,5,0],"order":10924}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0041","name":"诸葛恪","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0133","name":"张昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu064-q-13d8e693cd68e444b7cd","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-180c49f03c5557483ff2","layer":"original","quote":"命恪行酒，至张昭前；昭先有酒色〖9〗，不肯饮，曰：“此非养老之礼也。”权曰：“卿其能令张公辞屈，乃当饮之耳。”恪难昭曰：“昔师尚父九十〖10〗，秉旄仗钺〖11〗，犹未告老也。今军旅之事，将军在后〖12〗；酒食之事，将军在先：何谓不养老也？”昭卒无辞，遂为尽爵〖13〗。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
